# ── This repository ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The ledger does not belong in this repository: locally it is data/db/portfolio.db (ignored), hosted it
# is kept in a private repository (see README → Keeping the ledger). Sidecars and downloads too.
# (Until the private store holds it, the file is still tracked — force-added — so the hosted app keeps
# its ledger; it is removed, with its history, once the store has its first copy.)
data/db/*.db
data/db/*.db-wal
data/db/*.db-shm
data/db/*.download
